# testes rapidos da api (vs code com a extensao rest client, ou visual studio)
# 1) roda o login, 2) copia o token da resposta pro @token, 3) roda as outras
@api = http://localhost:3000
@token = cole_o_token_aqui

### saude (publica): mostra o usuario do mysql usado pela api
GET {{api}}/api/saude

### login
POST {{api}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "login": "admin", "senha": "fincore123" }

### saldos (view vw_saldo_cliente)
GET {{api}}/api/saldos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### clientes (tabela cliente)
GET {{api}}/api/clientes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### contas (view vw_contas_cliente)
GET {{api}}/api/contas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### extrato da conta 2 (view vw_extrato_conta)
GET {{api}}/api/contas/2/extrato
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### transferencia que da certo (commit), troca a chave a cada envio
POST {{api}}/api/transferencias
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "idContaOrigem": 2, "idContaDestino": 4, "valor": 50, "chave": "http-teste-001" }

### transferencia que falha (rollback): saldo insuficiente
POST {{api}}/api/transferencias
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "idContaOrigem": 2, "idContaDestino": 4, "valor": 1000000, "chave": "http-teste-002" }
